rooms_desc ({"You are at the end of a path in a large canyon.Towering walls of brown rock and granite loom onall three sides of you. You see little piles ofrubble at the foots of the cliffs. Except for a few field mice and a lizard or two, this placedoesnt look like too many have been here. Alllooks in place except for a steel door to the northwith a small terminal along side of it. There isa sign painted on the door.","You enter this room and the door behind youpounds shut. You start to feel a change in theair around you. As a series of gasses fill theroom, you feel refreshed. Just then, a door tothe west opens. You look around the room and seesmall holes with spouts extending from them.Other than that, the room is empty.","In this room, you see hundreds of people,going to and fro, about their business.There is a feeling of friendliness in theair here. You notice the Ambassador of thecolony smiling in your direction. As youlook around, you see chairs, couches, andstools for your comfort. There are foodand drink terminals along the walls. Youseem to feel at home here.","In this room, there are four large couchesthat are in the form of a square. In the centerof the 'square', there is a large table.This table serves as an entertainment centerfor those who just feel like taking a breakfrom it all. The table is voice activated,so all that is needed is a word and you can watch your favorite movie or television show.If not, you can just sit down and talk. Thereare more terminals along the walls. There is a sign above the north door.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Canyon","Pressure Chamber","Lobby","Common Room",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
